{"id":"u-a3a6be85-47b0-4c85-b32f-3db2145bf077","src":"community","title":"Malone 5 day full body part 2","author":"Mike Malone","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TBpiYg-malone-5-day-full-body-part-1-1","desc":"This High Frequency program has a main focus on muscle building but also gives cardio benefits from supersets and one circuit day.\n \nSome people may be skeptical of the High frequency but I try to incorporate different movement patterns so as to not have much overlap and overuse. \nNote that day 3 uses more explosive movements which causes less muscle fatigue. The circuit fashion keeps the heart rate up though. \nAlso it’s only a 4 week program. So if it doesn’t jive with you, you are not committing to 3+ months worth of something you don’t like. But If it works then give it another month. This is the program I currently just finished and will do another month with some tweaks to bring some freshness in. Once I finish that one, I will publish. \n\nAnd this is not an easy program. Scale it to your ability. If you need to cut it to 2 sets then do it. Make it your program. \n\nEnjoy and stay safe.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Athletics","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-14T14:50:59.409Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full Body lower Quad Focus","Full Body upper Shoulder focus","Full body 3","Full Body lower hams focus","Full Body back focus"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Safety Bar Squat","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Row","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Cossack Squat","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Side Crunch (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Standing Behind Neck Shoulder Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"